Ladybird’s feComposite operator=“out” now keeps the parts of the in
image outside of the in2 image. Blink maps it to SkBlendMode::kSrcOut in
FEComposite (fe_composite.cc), and WebKit’s FECompositeSoftwareApplier
draws in, then draws in2 over it with DestinationOut, which comes to the
same. Gecko’s source wasn’t traced, but Firefox 151.0 renders the new
reftest’s page and its reference identically, as Chrome 158.0.8127.36
and WebKit 26.5 do (engine-compare).
